And many days after that too, right?

640
43:21.040 --> 43:21.840
Yeah.

641
43:24.000 --> 43:25.560
They're just cheap pastries.

642
43:27.520 --> 43:28.560
So you like them.

643
43:35.120 --> 43:37.440
But I like the owner more.

644
43:49.160 --> 43:50.320
What?

645
43:50.320 --> 43:51.640
Wanna go another round?

646
43:51.640 --> 43:52.800
Stop it.

647
44:12.720 --> 44:14.000
Hi, hi!

648
44:14.480 --> 44:17.560
Good morning. I bought some snacks for you.

649
44:18.560 --> 44:19.680
Thank you.

650
44:19.920 --> 44:22.600
Well, looks like you're in a good mood.

651
44:22.600 --> 44:23.920
Any good news?

652
44:26.080 --> 44:27.160
We made up.

653
44:27.160 --> 44:29.040
I knew it!

654
44:30.080 --> 44:32.280
You didn't even call last night.

655
44:32.560 --> 44:33.760
I've got my suspicion.

656
44:34.040 --> 44:34.960
Yeah.

657
44:35.680 --> 44:36.680
I was with Parn.

658
44:37.320 --> 44:38.240
Yes.

659
44:38.480 --> 44:40.560
I can tell. No need to clarify.

660
44:46.280 --> 44:47.440
What's wrong?

661
44:47.800 --> 44:49.560
You've made up, so why are you sighing?

662
44:52.120 --> 44:55.480
The reason why she tried to break up with me

663
44:55.480 --> 44:56.840
and wouldn't come around...

664
44:58.080 --> 45:00.960
was partly because my dad asked her to.

665
45:03.400 --> 45:04.400
So what now?

666
45:04.800 --> 45:07.400
You two can't be together if your dad won't accept it.

667
45:18.480 --> 45:21.240
Hello, my friend!

668
45:22.600 --> 45:23.440
Miew, Pat.

669
45:23.440 --> 45:24.520
How was it?

670
45:24.520 --> 45:30.200
Did you and Ms. Peem work, work, work--

671
45:30.200 --> 45:31.240
Work out?

672
45:33.520 --> 45:35.120
Did you two work it out?

673
45:36.560 --> 45:37.560
Yeah.

674
45:40.800 --> 45:43.360
That means...

675
45:44.080 --> 45:49.200
you two have made up, right?

676
45:51.720 --> 45:52.720
Yeah.

677
45:55.520 --> 46:00.040
Finally! We've been on edge this whole time!

678
46:04.240 --> 46:06.320
It's your doing, right?

679
46:07.440 --> 46:08.760
- No. - No.

680
46:10.120 --> 46:11.400
You sound suspiciously high-pitched.

681
46:15.800 --> 46:18.880
Well, she seems to really love you.

682
46:21.240 --> 46:22.400
I love her too.

683
46:22.400 --> 46:24.560
Aww!

684
46:25.000 --> 46:26.800
- "I love her too." - "I love her too."

685
46:29.320 --> 46:33.000
But in the end, things might not work out.

686
46:33.640 --> 46:34.680
What?

687
46:35.360 --> 46:37.000
Why not? You love each other.

688
46:37.440 --> 46:38.320
Right.

689
46:39.400 --> 46:41.640
I don't know what Peem is going to do about her dad.

690
46:51.040 --> 46:52.080
Oh?

691
46:53.920 --> 46:55.400
Pong didn't come with you?

692
46:55.400 --> 46:56.400
No.

693
46:58.080 --> 47:00.160
I like your pastries.

694
47:03.680 --> 47:04.800
Then please have a seat.

695
47:07.160 --> 47:08.240
Hey.

696
47:09.640 --> 47:10.960
Does he like the pastries,

697
47:10.960 --> 47:12.760
or does he like the owner?

698
47:12.760 --> 47:14.960
Jeez. What a stupid question.

699
47:15.200 --> 47:16.920
- The owner. - Yes.

700
47:17.240 --> 47:18.920
Why did he have to come?

701
47:25.120 --> 47:27.280
Where are you going, my angel?

702
47:36.560 --> 47:37.560
Ms. Peem!

703
47:37.560 --> 47:39.080
Let go! I said let go!

704
47:45.280 --> 47:46.200
Peem...

705
47:53.200 --> 48:00.320
♪ Even though my heart says I love you ♪

706
48:00.320 --> 48:05.160
♪ Why am I like this? ♪

707
48:05.600 --> 48:08.240
♪ I don't understand ♪

708
48:08.240 --> 48:13.680
♪ What's wrong with my mouth and my heart? ♪

709
48:13.680 --> 48:18.160
♪ Why won't they say the same thing? ♪
